  "idea": "Stripe vs Lemon Squeezy: which merchant of record is best for digital creators",
  "text": "The fee comparison between Stripe and Lemon Squeezy is deceiving for new founders. Creators see Stripe's low processing percentage and assume Lemon Squeezy's five percent fee is too expensive. However, Stripe requires paid add-ons for tax calculation, automated billing, and cross-border invoicing compliance. Lemon Squeezy covers global tax liability, chargeback protection, and currency conversion inside a single unified fee. That saves thousands in hidden accounting fees.",
